<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kanji Quiz - Nihongology</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Yomogi&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/kanji-quiz.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg">
        <div class="container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
                <i class="fas fa-torii-gate me-2"></i>Nihongology
            </a>
            <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav">
                <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
            </button>
            <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
                <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto">
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/kana"><i class="fas fa-font me-1"></i>Kana</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/kanji"><i class="fas fa-kanji me-1"></i>Kanji</a></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/vocab"><i class="fas fa-book me-1"></i>Vocabulary</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    
    <div class="container mt-4">
        <div class="row">
            <!-- Sidebar -->
            <aside class="col-md-3 col-lg-2 sidebar">
                <div class="list-group">
                    <a href="/kanji" class="list-group-item list-group-item-action" data-section="kanji-section">
                        <i class="fas fa-list me-2"></i>JLPT Levels
                    </a>
                    <a href="/kanji-quiz" class="list-group-item list-group-item-action active" data-section="quiz-section">
                        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap me-2"></i>Quiz
                    </a>
                </div>
                
                <div class="sidebar-info">
                    <h5 class="mb-3"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb me-2"></i>Quiz Tips</h5>
                    <p class="small">Challenge yourself with kanji from different JLPT levels. Regular practice helps with retention!</p>
                    
                    <div class="achievement-section">
                        <h6><i class="fas fa-trophy me-2"></i> Your Stats</h6>
                        <div class="achievement-item">
                            <span>Quizzes Taken:</span>
                            <span class="badge bg-primary" id="quizzes-taken">0</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="achievement-item">
                            <span>Avg. Score:</span>
                            <span class="badge bg-success" id="avg-score">0%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="achievement-item">
                            <span>Streak:</span>
                            <span class="badge bg-warning" id="current-streak">0 days</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </aside>
            
            <!-- Main Content -->
            <main class="col-md-9 col-lg-10">
                <div class="quiz-page-wrapper">
                    <div class="quiz-header text-center">
                        <h1 class="display-5">漢字クイズ</h1>
                        <p class="lead">Test your Japanese kanji knowledge</p>
                        <div class="decorative-line"></div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- Quiz Container -->
                    <div class="quiz-container fade-in">
                        <div class="quiz-card">
                            <!-- Quiz Settings -->
                            <div class="quiz-settings">
                                <h2><i class="fas fa-cog me-2"></i> Quiz Settings</h2>
                                
                                <div class="row g-4">
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <div class="setting-block">
                                            <label for="level-select" class="form-label">Select JLPT Level</label>
                                            <select id="level-select" class="form-select">
                                                <option value="n4">JLPT N5</option>
                                                <option value="n3">JLPT N4</option>
                                                <option value="n2">JLPT N2/N3</option>
                                                <option value="n1">JLPT N1</option>
                                            </select>
                                            <div id="level-description" class="level-description">
                                                <strong>N5:</strong> Basic kanji for beginners
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <div class="setting-block">
                                            <label for="question-count" class="form-label">Number of Questions</label>
                                            <div class="range-container">
                                                <input type="range" id="question-count" class="form-range" min="5" max="50" value="10" oninput="this.nextElementSibling.value = this.value">
                                                <output>10</output> questions
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="question-suggestion">
                                                We recommend 10-20 questions per session
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="quiz-type-selection">
                                    <h5>Quiz Focus</h5>
                                    <div class="quiz-type-options">
                                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="quizType" id="both" value="both" checked>
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="both">Both Directions</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="quizType" id="kanji-to-meaning" value="kanji-to-meaning">
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="kanji-to-meaning">Kanji → Meaning</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                            <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="quizType" id="meaning-to-kanji" value="meaning-to-kanji">
                                            <label class="form-check-label" for="meaning-to-kanji">Meaning → Kanji</label>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="text-center mt-4">
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary quiz-btn" id="start-quiz">
                                        <i class="fas fa-play-circle me-2"></i>Start Quiz
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Quiz Area -->
                            <div id="quiz-area" class="text-center d-none">
                                <div class="quiz-progress">
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2">
                                        <span class="question-counter">Question 1/10</span>
                                        <span class="score-counter">Score: 0</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="progress">
                                        <div class="progress-bar" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="kanji-display-area">
                                    <div id="quiz-kanji" class="fade-in"></div>
                                    <div id="quiz-reading" class="reading-display d-none"></div>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div id="quiz-options" class="options-grid fade-in">
                                    <!-- Options will be added here dynamically -->
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="feedback-area d-none" id="feedback-area">
                                    <!-- Feedback message will go here -->
                                </div>
                                
                                <button class="btn btn-primary quiz-btn d-none" id="next-question">
                                    Next Question <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Result Section -->
                            <div id="quiz-result" class="text-center d-none">
                                <div class="result-header">
                                    <i class="fas fa-award result-icon"></i>
                                    <h3>Quiz Complete!</h3>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="result-stats">
                                    <div class="score-display">
                                        <div class="score-circle">
                                            <span id="score-percentage">80%</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <h4 id="score-text">You scored 8 out of 10!</h4>
                                    <p class="result-message" id="result-message">Well done! Keep practicing to improve.</p>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div class="result-actions">
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary quiz-btn" id="restart-quiz">
                                        <i class="fas fa-redo me-2"></i>Try Again
                                    </button>
                                    <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" id="review-mistakes">
                                        <i class="fas fa-search me-2"></i>Review Mistakes
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                
                                <div id="mistake-review" class="mistake-review d-none">
                                    <h5 class="review-title">Kanji to Review</h5>
                                    <div class="review-items">
                                        <!-- Mistake items will be added here -->
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="quiz-footer">
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-brain me-2"></i> Memory Tip</h5>
                                <p>Studies show that regular testing improves memory retention by up to 50%. Testing yourself forces active recall, which strengthens neural connections.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-clock me-2"></i> Time Management</h5>
                                <p>Break your study sessions into 20-25 minute chunks with short breaks in between. This technique, known as the Pomodoro method, optimizes focus and learning efficiency.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="info-card">
                                <h5><i class="fas fa-calendar-check me-2"></i> Consistency</h5>
                                <p>Learning just 5-10 new kanji per day and reviewing them regularly is more effective than cramming many characters at once. Build a daily study habit for best results.</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </main>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <footer class="footer mt-5">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <p>© 2025 Nihongology - The modern way to learn Japanese</p>
            <div class="social-links mt-3">
                <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-twitter"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a>
                <a href="#" class="social-link"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>
    
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.6.4/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="js/kanji-quiz.js"></script>
</body>
</html>